sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Developer
    participant Script as Controller Script (train_cifar10.py)
    participant Core as Controller Engine (SDK / Launcher)
    participant Pi02d as Pi02 Daemon (192.168.10.150:45870)
    participant Pi02p as Pi02 Worker Process (Rank 0)
    participant Pi03d as Pi03 Daemon (192.168.10.101:45870)
    participant Pi03p as Pi03 Worker Process (Rank 1)

    %% Phase 1: Configuration & Resolution
    Note over User,Core: Phase 1: Discovery & IP Resolution
    User->>Script: python3 example/train_cifar10.py
    Script->>Core: cluster = Optimus(config="config.yaml")
    Core->>Core: Avahi mDNS / DNS resolution:<br/>pi02.local -> 192.168.10.150<br/>pi03.local -> 192.168.10.101
    Core->>Pi02d: TCP :45870 StatusRequest / ResourceRequest
    Pi02d-->>Core: StatusResponse (State=AVAILABLE, 8GB RAM, 4 Cores)
    Core->>Pi03d: TCP :45870 StatusRequest / ResourceRequest
    Pi03d-->>Core: StatusResponse (State=AVAILABLE, 8GB RAM, 4 Cores)

    %% Phase 2: Scheduling & Job Dispatch
    Note over Script,Pi03d: Phase 2: Scheduler & TCP Job Dispatch
    Script->>Core: trainer.fit()
    Core->>Core: Scheduler selects nodes & sets Rendezvous:<br/>Rank 0 = 192.168.10.150 (pi02)<br/>Rank 1 = 192.168.10.101 (pi03)<br/>MASTER_ADDR = 192.168.10.150, MASTER_PORT = 29500
    
    Core->>Pi02d: TCP :45870 JobSubmit(rank=0, world_size=2, master_addr="192.168.10.150", port=29500)
    Pi02d-->>Core: JobResponse(accepted=True)
    Core->>Pi03d: TCP :45870 JobSubmit(rank=1, world_size=2, master_addr="192.168.10.150", port=29500)
    Pi03d-->>Core: JobResponse(accepted=True)

    %% Phase 3: Subprocess Spawning
    Note over Pi02d,Pi03p: Phase 3: Environment Injection & Subprocess Spawning
    Pi02d->>Pi02p: subprocess.Popen(worker_entry.py)<br/>env: RANK=0, MASTER_ADDR=192.168.10.150, MASTER_PORT=29500
    Pi03d->>Pi03p: subprocess.Popen(worker_entry.py)<br/>env: RANK=1, MASTER_ADDR=192.168.10.150, MASTER_PORT=29500

    %% Phase 4: PyTorch Gloo Rendezvous
    Note over Pi02p,Pi03p: Phase 4: PyTorch Gloo Rendezvous
    Pi02p->>Pi02p: dist.init_process_group("gloo")<br/>Binds TCPStore server on 0.0.0.0:29500
    Pi03p->>Pi02p: TCP Connect 192.168.10.150:29500 (Gloo TCPStore handshake)
    Pi02p-->>Pi03p: TCP Handshake ACK (Gloo full mesh connected)

    %% Phase 5: Training Loop & Gradient AllReduce
    Note over Pi02p,Pi03p: Phase 5: DistributedSampler & Gradient AllReduce
    Pi02p->>Pi02p: DistributedSampler shards data: Even indices [0, 2, 4, ...]
    Pi03p->>Pi03p: DistributedSampler shards data: Odd indices [1, 3, 5, ...]
    
    loop Every Mini-Batch (loss.backward)
        Pi02p->>Pi02p: Local forward pass & loss computation
        Pi03p->>Pi03p: Local forward pass & loss computation
        Note over Pi02p,Pi03p: loss.backward() triggers autograd hook
        Pi02p<<->>Pi03p: Gloo Ring-AllReduce over Ethernet: Exchange and average gradients
        Pi02p->>Pi02p: optimizer.step() updates weights locally
        Pi03p->>Pi03p: optimizer.step() updates weights locally (Weights identical)
    end

    %% Phase 6: Completion & Teardown
    Note over Core,Pi03p: Phase 6: Finalization & Metrics
    Pi02p->>Pi02p: Rank 0 saves final_model.pt
    Pi02p->>Pi02d: Process exits (code 0)
    Pi03p->>Pi03d: Process exits (code 0)
    Core->>Pi02d: Poll JobStatusRequest -> COMPLETED
    Core->>Pi03d: Poll JobStatusRequest -> COMPLETED
    Core-->>Script: Training metrics & final_model.pt artifact path
    Script-->>User: Training Complete (Loss: 1.9769)
